Z||000000||Paulv||04-24-2001||09:35 AM||||Always wanted to own your Fiero "dream" car?? Here is your chance to WIN a<BR>1988 Fiero GT T-Top 5-speed in the 2001 NIFE 2001 Raffle!! We have "found"<BR>the ideal car....a Red 88GT, 5-speed, T-Top, #10 of the 1252 T-Tops in the<BR>Cars & Concepts build order for the Fiero. THIS specific car was at the 1988<BR>Auto show in Chicago's McCormick Place in the Pontiac display booth. The<BR>original owner bought it at the show and sold it in 1991 to a local<BR>enthusiast who owned it until this year. It currently has 65,700 miles on<BR>the odometer. We updated many of the mechanical components (new shocks,<BR>struts, brakes, stock refinished wheels, new tires, alignment, etc.) This<BR>car looks great, and drives like new!<P>Then to make this years GT raffle even more exciting, we have added a 2nd<BR>place prize of a Mr Mikes leather interior  makeover, with a value of<BR>$1400.00, PLUS a 3rd place of a $500.00 gift certificate to the Fiero Store.<P>The car and the runner up prizes will be awarded at the 6th annual NIFE<BR>Fierorama in Oak Brook IL. on September 9th, 2001. Raffle ticket sales<BR>started on Saturday April 21st at V8Archies V8 seminar in Barrington, IL.<P>We will only sell 600 tickets total. You do not need to be present to win!<BR>Just be at your phone at about 4:30PM Chicago time on Sunday Sept. 9th when<BR>we call you if we draw your winning ticket!! (If you are not there, you still win!) Tickets are $20.00. Since there<BR>are 3 major prizes, you have a 1 in 200 chance in winning something! (Sure<BR>beats the lottery!)<P>A complete write up on the car, with 8 pictures, a list of all the Mr Mikes<BR>products included in the 2nd place prize, along with a raffle ticket order<BR>form can be found at:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fierofocus.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierofocus.com</A> <P>Just click on the picture of the 88GT T-Top with the "win me" banner!!<P><BR>Paul Vargyas<BR>Northern Illinois Fiero Enthusiasts<BR>Lisle, IL. (Chicago area)<BR>Web site  <A HREF="http://home.xnet.com/~paulv" TARGET=_blank>http://home.xnet.com/~paulv</A> <P>||||reg||1
